of exactly this statement. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-mersenne-channel-growth"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-mersenne-channel-growth"],"id":"long.thm-mersenne-channel-growth","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.25 (Exponential growth of the reduced denominators)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.25, p. 51, label thm:mersenne-channel-growth","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For an integer $t\\ge5$, put\n$$\nH_t=\\operatorname{lcm}(1,\\ldots,t),\\quad\n r_t=\\prod_{p\\le t}p,\\quad h_t=H_t/r_t,\\quad\n D_t=\\operatorname{den}\\bigl(h_tB(r_t)\\bigr),\n$$\nwhere the product is over primes. Then $D_t\\ge2^{t/2}$. Its exact denominator is\n$$\nD_t=\\frac{2^{r_t}-1}{\\gcd(2^{r_t}-1,h_tA_{r_t})}.\n$$*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.thm-mersenne-channel-growth","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.thm-mersenne-channel-growth","id":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.thm-mersenne-channel-growth%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.MersenneShadowDenominatorGrowth.lcmHeight_scaledMobiusShadow_den_exact%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.thm-mersenne-channel-growth%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.MersenneShadowDenominatorGrowth.lcmHeight_scaledMobiusShadow_den_exact%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.MersenneShadowDenominatorGrowth.lcmHeight_scaledMobiusShadow_den_exact"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.thm-mersenne-channel